DESCRIPTION:Times: 3:30pm\, 5:40pm\, 7:50pm\nAfter decades of being blown t
 o bits by bombs\, demolished by dynamite\, mangled by magnets\, battered b
 y boulders\, trampled by trains\, tricked by tunnels\, sprung by springs\,
  steamrolled by steamrollers\, maligned by misfires\, bedeviled by bungees
 \, rattled by rockets\, backstabbed by bat suits\, rocked by rocket skates
 \, upended by unicycles\, quaked by quake pills\, rubberized by rogue band
 s\, and hurled headlong off every cliff in the Southwest\, Wile E. Coyote 
 (Genius) finally fights back. Teaming up with billboard accident lawyer Ke
 vin Avery (Will Forte)\, he takes on slick corporate counsel Buddy Crane (
 John Cena) and ACME\, Inc.\, the profit-obsessed conglomerate behind every
  one of the Coyote’s chaotic catastrophes.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema
 .com/movie/coyote-vs-acme\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/bosto
 n/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/coyote-vs-acme
