DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:25pm\, 7:10pm\nA companion piece to the hit film The S
 ocial Network\, Aaron Sorkin’s original screenplay is based on the event
 s that gave rise to the Wall Street Journal’s shocking exposé The Faceb
 ook Files. The film is inspired by the true story of how Frances Haugen (M
 adison)\, a young Facebook engineer\, enlists the help of Jeff Horwitz (Wh
 ite)\, a Wall Street Journal reporter\, to go on a dangerous journey that 
 ends up blowing the whistle on the social network’s most guarded secrets
 .\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/5c4a260d-cc06-52c
